{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tags"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"tags","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to set for the current device","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags are key-value pairs that enable targeted push notifications based on user attributes"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and behavior. Use tags to segment your audience and send personalized messages to specific"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user groups."}]},{"anchor":"Supported-Tag-Types","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Supported Tag Types"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Type","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Example","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"String","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"city\": \"New York\""}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text values","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integer"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"age\": 25"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Numeric values"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Boolean","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"isPremium\": true"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"True\/false values","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"List","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"interests\": [\"sports\", \"music\"]","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrays of strings"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Date"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"lastPurchase\": Date()"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NSDate objects"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"text":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update user profile tags after account changes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func updateUserTags(for user: User) {","        var tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"user_id\": user.id,","            \"email_verified\": user.isEmailVerified,","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"signup_date\": user.createdAt,","            \"app_version\": Bundle.main.appVersion","        ]","","        \/\/ Add subscription info if premium","        if let subscription = user.subscription {","            tags[\"subscription_tier\"] = subscription.tier.rawValue","            tags[\"subscription_expiry\"] = subscription.expiryDate","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = true","        } else {","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = false","        }","","        \/\/ Add user preferences","        if !user.interests.isEmpty {","            tags[\"interests\"] = user.interests","        }","","        \/\/ Add location if available","        if let location = user.location {","            tags[\"country\"] = location.country","            tags[\"city\"] = location.city","            tags[\"timezone\"] = location.timezone","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags)","        Logger.debug(\"User tags updated: \\(tags.keys.joined(separator: \", \"))\")","    }","","    func trackPurchase(product: Product, amount: Decimal) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"last_purchase_date\": Date(),","            \"last_purchase_amount\": NSDecimalNumber(decimal: amount),","            \"last_purchase_category\": product.category,","            \"total_purchases\": incrementTag(\"total_purchases\")","        ])","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setTags:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setTags:","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setTags:":{"type":"topic","title":"setTags:","abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguratio